
  Horcrux (Gentoo-based live / installer)
  ----------------------------------------
  Install to disk : live-installer              (guided installer)
  Live console    : root is passwordless here (physical access only); sshd is OFF
  Wi-Fi           : iwctl   (then: station wlan0 connect <ssid>)
  After installing: https://<ip>:8006  user: admin  (the password you chose)

